            "review_text": "Tdavids62\nParis, France80 contributions\n0\nBad, Cher... and scam at the table!\nDec 2024 • Family\nBad dim sum, tasteless and expensive dishes... Very disappointing because the bright sign at street level seemed promising... photo and attractive fare... but fall off you very high! The dishes without flavor follow each other... very slowly and surprised of the chef... We charge you a saucer of a dozen peanuts that the waiter had placed on the table after we ordered wine! When we point out that we had not asked for anything and that this dozen poor peanuts arrived at the same time as the wine... We are told that yes, it is not paying unless the customers eat!! I hadn’t seen this scam yet... In short, we will fortunately never come back, but sad evening to have chosen this Crystal Jade Palace whose mediocrity we will never forget because of its avarice for some peanuts!\nRead more\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten December 30, 2024",
